{
  "$comment": "Structures this template needs in a client's Sapt project. Sapt's Project Settings → Funnel → Prepare project reads this off the repository's default branch and provisions it idempotently. It is the minimum for the site to work: the CRM types the quote form and the text-back workflows write to, and the two brand colors. The full client project (CMS content types, demo content, workflows, roles) comes from the project template snapshot; see scripts/sapt-template.mjs and docs/ONBOARDING.md.",
  "objectTypes": [
    {
